WEBVTT

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:36.990 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:39.890 line:0%
[Episode 27]

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:41.839 line:0%
Guards!

00:01:44.110 --> 00:01:46.589 line:0%
[Uphold Virtue Selflessly]

00:01:44.970 --> 00:01:46.270 line:0%
Let everyone know

00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:48.550 line:0%
I deeply grieved the death

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:50.640 line:0%
of Discipline Inspector Bi Qiu.

00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:53.000 line:0%
You must thoroughly investigate this matter.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:54.200 line:0%
From this day forward,

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:55.279 line:0%
keep the city gates closed.

00:01:55.279 --> 00:01:56.880 line:0%
Don't let anyone in or out of the city.

00:01:56.480 --> 00:02:01.250 line:0%
[Uphold Virtue Selflessly]

00:01:56.880 --> 00:01:58.960 line:0%
I will personally interrogate any suspicious individuals.

00:01:58.960 --> 00:01:59.760 line:0%
Yes.

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:11.170 line:0%
Thank you, Grand Commander,

00:02:11.370 --> 00:02:12.440 line:0%
for what you did for Bi Qiu just now.

00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:14.170 line:0%
You helped him get rid of pains.

00:02:16.520 --> 00:02:17.320 line:0%
Today,

00:02:17.720 --> 00:02:18.720 line:0%
I must go to the South Mountain

00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:20.040 line:0%
to comfort his family.

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:22.879 line:0%
His father

00:02:22.879 --> 00:02:25.470 line:0%
spends his days raising pigeons on the South Mountain.

00:02:25.470 --> 00:02:26.470 line:0%
Now,

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:28.879 line:0%
his son died young.

00:02:29.020 --> 00:02:32.360 line:0%
[Uphold Virtue Selflessly]

00:02:29.720 --> 00:02:30.680 line:0%
When I'm back,

00:02:31.240 --> 00:02:32.440 line:0%
I'll discuss with you

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:35.270 line:0%
about how to eliminate the Half-faced Ghosts.

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:37.340 line:0%
My condolences, Governor Mo.

00:02:44.490 --> 00:02:45.550 line:0%
Raising pigeons?

00:02:46.879 --> 00:02:47.820 line:0%
I

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:50.160 line:0%
fear that Mo Qianzhi, the prefectural governor of Yingzhou,

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:51.600 line:0%
may have developed ulterior motives.

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:54.110 line:0%
So I order you to conduct a covert investigation.

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:56.280 line:0%
When the red-feathered gray pigeon arrives,

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:57.760 line:0%
messages can be sent.

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:00.480 line:0%
Was Bi Qiu

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:02.080 line:0%
Grand Empress Dowager's

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:03.640 line:0%
spy planted in Yingzhou?

00:03:04.480 --> 00:03:05.280 line:0%
Was Bi Qiu

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:09.050 line:0%
the go-between through whom I should pass messages?

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:18.320 line:0%
Alright.

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:21.080 line:0%
What's wrong?

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:24.640 line:0%
I think

00:03:27.160 --> 00:03:29.400 line:0%
I know why Bi Qiu was killed,

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:33.100 line:0%
but I can't say it.

00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:40.760 line:0%
Okay.

00:03:43.760 --> 00:03:46.290 line:0%
If you don't want to talk about it, then don't.

00:03:50.090 --> 00:03:50.890 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:54.520 line:0%
Do you trust me?

00:03:58.420 --> 00:03:59.870 line:0%
If one day,

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:02.680 line:0%
your closest person and I

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:04.140 line:0%
are on the opposite sides,

00:04:07.110 --> 00:04:08.750 line:0%
will you still trust me?

00:04:24.390 --> 00:04:25.630 line:0%
My closest person?

00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:31.460 line:0%
Isn't it you?

00:05:04.210 --> 00:05:06.830 line:0%
[Li's Tea House]

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:05.680 line:0%
I'm sorry.

00:05:06.120 --> 00:05:07.880 line:0%
It seems the news I got was wrong.

00:05:07.880 --> 00:05:08.920 line:0%
It said

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:11.610 line:0%
there were traces of Half-faced Ghosts on the outskirts.

00:05:11.610 --> 00:05:13.110 line:0%
Where are the Half-faced Ghosts?

00:05:13.110 --> 00:05:14.640 line:0%
There isn't a soul in sight.

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:23.180 line:0%
Excuse me, sir.

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:24.760 line:0%
Do you know

00:05:25.240 --> 00:05:26.640 line:0%
what happened today?

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:28.520 line:0%
How come there isn't

00:05:28.880 --> 00:05:30.000 line:0%
even a street vendor

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:31.240 line:0%
in or outside the city?

00:05:31.240 --> 00:05:32.040 line:0%
Young man.

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:33.680 line:0%
You must be new here.

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:35.040 line:0%
You came at a bad time.

00:05:35.040 --> 00:05:36.000 line:0%
Yesterday morning,

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:36.920 line:0%
the Half-faced Ghosts

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:39.840 line:0%
killed Discipline Inspector Bi Qiu at the magistrate's office.

00:05:39.840 --> 00:05:41.850 line:0%
I heard it was a gruesome scene.

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:43.240 line:0%
He was even skinned.

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:44.980 line:0%
Who would dare to come out now?

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:45.920 line:0%
I'm in a hurry

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:47.320 line:0%
to take medicine to my mother who's outside the city.

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:48.450 line:0%
That's why I'm here.

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:49.920 line:0%
I must go now.

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:53.420 line:0%
The Half-faced Ghosts

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:54.600 line:0%
entered the magistrate's office around 3 a.m.

00:05:54.600 --> 00:05:55.840 line:0%
to commit the crime.

00:05:55.880 --> 00:05:56.520 line:0%
Only we

00:05:56.520 --> 00:05:57.810 line:0%
and a few people from the office knew about it.

00:05:57.810 --> 00:05:59.160 line:0%
How did the residents

00:05:59.180 --> 00:06:00.610 line:0%
in the city know about this?

00:06:00.610 --> 00:06:02.140 line:0%
This is indeed suspicious.

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:04.350 line:0%
Someone must have deliberately spread the news.

00:06:04.350 --> 00:06:06.010 line:0%
Otherwise, how come everyone in the big Yingzhou

00:06:06.010 --> 00:06:07.280 line:0%
has heard about it

00:06:07.420 --> 00:06:10.480 line:0%
and the city has turned into a ghost town in just one day?

00:06:14.880 --> 00:06:15.640 line:0%
Secretary Yan.

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:16.400 line:0%
General Sun has sent a message.

00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:16.800 line:0%
At the city gate,

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:18.000 line:0%
there are Half-faced Ghosts holding civilians hostage.

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:19.860 line:0%
Please hurry there immediately.

00:06:25.840 --> 00:06:27.360 line:0%
Moths to a flame.

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:29.440 line:0%
Born at dawn, dead by dusk

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:31.680 line:0%
Not entering the cycle of reincarnation.

00:06:31.680 --> 00:06:33.720 line:0%
Immortal reincarnation.

00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:35.120 line:0%
What are they doing?

00:06:35.140 --> 00:06:37.470 line:0%
They are performing a ritual.

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:45.040 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:50.959 line:0%
Good.

00:06:51.170 --> 00:06:54.270 line:0%
[East City Gate]

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:54.000 line:0%
Everyone who should be here has arrived.

00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:54.880 line:0%
Next,

00:06:54.880 --> 00:06:56.680 line:0%
I will show you how to eat people.

00:06:58.520 --> 00:07:00.320 line:0%
That knife is the Curved Sword from the Western Region.

00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:02.640 line:0%
It was used to cut off Li Kaixiang's head.

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:04.040 line:0%
Half-faced Ghosts.

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:05.530 line:0%
What exactly are you planning to do?

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:06.630 line:0%
[East City Gate]

00:07:07.240 --> 00:07:08.600 line:0%
We're to pay tribute to gods

00:07:08.600 --> 00:07:10.260 line:0%
and pray for their blessings.

00:07:12.860 --> 00:07:13.890 line:0%
Half-faced Ghost.

00:07:13.890 --> 00:07:15.280 line:0%
If you don't want to die in pieces,

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:16.360 line:0%
let them go.

00:07:16.110 --> 00:07:17.820 line:0%
[East City Gate]

00:07:17.280 --> 00:07:18.270 line:0%
Stop!

00:07:18.340 --> 00:07:20.200 line:0%
What exactly are you trying to do?

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:21.520 line:0%
Mo Qianzhi.

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:23.130 line:0%
You've come at the right time.

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:24.950 line:0%
The Day of Three Yangs is approaching.

00:07:24.950 --> 00:07:26.150 line:0%
Let the five ladies go

00:07:26.600 --> 00:07:27.800 line:0%
and we can negotiate.

00:07:28.600 --> 00:07:29.400 line:0%
Very well.

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:31.990 line:0%
It depends on how sincere you are.

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:33.440 line:0%
If you promise

00:07:33.440 --> 00:07:34.200 line:0%
that starting from today,

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:35.880 line:0%
you'll stop investigating the Half-faced Ghost case,

00:07:35.880 --> 00:07:37.120 line:0%
I will let them go.

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:39.150 line:0%
If you don't agree,

00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:40.400 line:0%
the people in the entire Yingzhou City

00:07:40.400 --> 00:07:41.720 line:0%
will be slaughtered.

00:07:41.840 --> 00:07:42.640 line:0%
Shut up!

00:07:43.320 --> 00:07:44.850 line:0%
How dare you be so arrogant!

00:07:45.050 --> 00:07:46.959 line:0%
Discipline Inspector Bi Qiu was devoted to serving the people

00:07:46.959 --> 00:07:48.540 line:0%
as everyone in Yingzhou knows.

00:07:48.540 --> 00:07:50.280 line:0%
Yet you cruelly murdered him,

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:51.560 line:0%
skinning him alive and tearing out his tendons,

00:07:51.560 --> 00:07:53.520 line:0%
and making him extremely painful.

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:55.680 line:0%
You are inhuman!

00:07:56.520 --> 00:07:58.200 line:0%
So you're refusing then?

00:07:58.200 --> 00:07:59.920 line:0%
Do you want all the people in the city to die,

00:07:59.920 --> 00:08:01.000 line:0%
or do you want them?

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:01.960 line:0%
Attack!

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:11.720 line:0%
Darn it!

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:12.560 line:0%
Kill them!

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:16.560 line:0%
Close the city gate!

00:08:16.560 --> 00:08:17.490 line:0%
Fire the arrows!

00:08:17.950 --> 00:08:18.500 line:0%
[East City Gate]

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:20.950 line:0%
[Yingzhou City]

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:41.089 line:0%
Pan Chi!

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:43.880 line:0%
Senior!

00:08:43.900 --> 00:08:45.720 line:0%
No! Stop immediately!

00:08:46.570 --> 00:08:48.400 line:0%
The Half-faced Ghosts have harmed so many innocent people.

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:49.580 line:0%
We must kill him!

00:08:48.760 --> 00:08:49.200 line:0%
[East City Gate]

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:51.760 line:0%
How is he?

00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:52.870 line:0%
Not going to die.

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:55.400 line:0%
This dart is poisoned.

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:57.930 line:0%
We need to help him stop the bleeding quickly.

00:08:58.380 --> 00:08:59.540 line:0%
Stay here.

00:08:59.610 --> 00:09:01.340 line:0%
Don't come out, no matter what.

00:09:07.840 --> 00:09:08.780 line:0%
Hang in there.

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:13.240 line:0%
Pan Chi, hang in there.

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:16.530 line:0%
Pan Chi, don't fall asleep.

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:20.200 line:0%
Don't fall asleep.

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:21.560 line:0%
Pan Chi.

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:23.450 line:0%
Pan Chi, don't fall asleep!

00:09:25.970 --> 00:09:28.290 line:0%
Pan Chi! Pan Chi!

00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:34.320 line:0%
I never thought

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:35.920 line:0%
that one day you would hold a knife

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:37.280 line:0%
onto my neck.

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:41.280 line:0%
Let them stop firing arrows.

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:42.700 line:0%
I'm afraid I can't do it.

00:09:43.360 --> 00:09:44.360 line:0%
This is a rare opportunity

00:09:44.360 --> 00:09:45.600 line:0%
to eliminate Half-faced Ghosts.

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:47.000 line:0%
How can I let them get away?

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:48.200 line:0%
For the sake of the people of Yingzhou,

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:49.760 line:0%
I'd rather kill by mistake than let him go.

00:09:49.760 --> 00:09:51.200 line:0%
If any innocent people are killed,

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:52.880 line:0%
I, Mo, will pay with my life.

00:09:52.880 --> 00:09:55.080 line:0%
Executing a court-appointed official is a capital offense!

00:09:54.910 --> 00:09:57.730 line:0%
[East City Gate]

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:56.380 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen.

00:09:56.480 --> 00:09:58.280 line:0%
Don't try to intimidate me with threats of execution.

00:09:58.280 --> 00:09:59.760 line:0%
I am devoted to serving my people.

00:09:59.760 --> 00:10:01.240 line:0%
I'm determined to eliminate Half-faced Ghosts

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:02.970 line:0%
and restore peace to my people.

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:04.680 line:0%
Even in front of the Grand Empress Dowager,

00:10:04.680 --> 00:10:05.960 line:0%
I would say the same thing.

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:07.250 line:0%
Open your eyes and look!

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:09.160 line:0%
Is this the result you wanted?

00:10:10.450 --> 00:10:11.880 line:0%
If Xiuxiu were here,

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:13.400 line:0%
would she want to see

00:10:13.400 --> 00:10:15.280 line:0%
you become like this?

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:18.120 line:0%
Xiuxiu.

00:10:24.780 --> 00:10:26.140 line:0%
Stop firing arrows!

00:10:27.580 --> 00:10:29.670 line:0%
[East City Gate]

00:10:37.880 --> 00:10:38.680 line:0%
Xing.

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:47.130 line:0%
[East City Gate]

00:10:50.350 --> 00:10:51.250 line:0%
[East City Gate]

00:11:07.960 --> 00:11:09.170 line:0%
Guangchun Hall.

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:13.560 line:0%
So this is the headquarters of the Fire Moth Sect.

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:25.600 line:0%
Well, well.

00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:40.560 line:0%
It really is you.

00:11:40.910 --> 00:11:41.750 line:0%
Ji Dafu.

00:11:42.600 --> 00:11:44.480 line:0%
First, you killed Li Kaixiang,

00:11:44.640 --> 00:11:46.410 line:0%
and then framed Li Kairui.

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:47.960 line:0%
After that, you made Liu Zongyuan

00:11:47.960 --> 00:11:49.120 line:0%
the scapegoat for you.

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:50.760 line:0%
What exactly are you up to?

00:11:50.760 --> 00:11:52.840 line:0%
I didn't frame Li Kairui.

00:11:52.970 --> 00:11:55.220 line:0%
I even paid to clear his name.

00:11:55.430 --> 00:11:57.060 line:0%
Li Kaixiang...

00:11:57.680 --> 00:11:59.240 line:0%
I killed him and so what?

00:12:00.760 --> 00:12:01.880 line:0%
He deserved to die.

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:03.720 line:0%
Liu Zongyuan deserved to die too.

00:12:03.720 --> 00:12:04.960 line:0%
Those foolish commoners...

00:12:04.960 --> 00:12:06.470 line:0%
Their lives were not important at all.

00:12:06.470 --> 00:12:07.320 line:0%
I'm afraid it's you

00:12:07.320 --> 00:12:08.740 line:0%
who are the most foolish person.

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:09.720 line:0%
The civilians you killed

00:12:09.720 --> 00:12:10.760 line:0%
were so innocent.

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:12.240 line:0%
You were once a son and a husband.

00:12:12.240 --> 00:12:13.970 line:0%
You also had parents and a wife.

00:12:14.720 --> 00:12:16.520 line:0%
Do you know how painful it is

00:12:16.520 --> 00:12:18.000 line:0%
when loved ones die tragically?

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:18.960 line:0%
Shut up!

00:12:20.580 --> 00:12:22.050 line:0%
The pain brought by

00:12:23.440 --> 00:12:24.320 line:0%
the deaths of loved ones

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:26.280 line:0%
can't be more familiar to me.

00:12:29.950 --> 00:12:31.990 line:0%
But when I saw Xiulian,

00:12:33.200 --> 00:12:35.760 line:0%
s-s-she had become so deformed.

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:38.890 line:0%
She was unrecognizable.

00:12:45.340 --> 00:12:46.800 line:0%
But they promised me

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:48.320 line:0%
they would bring Xiulian back to life.

00:12:48.320 --> 00:12:49.720 line:0%
She will come back.

00:12:49.800 --> 00:12:50.720 line:0%
Who are they?

00:12:50.760 --> 00:12:51.560 line:0%
They promised you

00:12:51.560 --> 00:12:53.560 line:0%
that they could resurrect Xiulian?

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:56.010 line:0%
Unfortunately,

00:12:56.520 --> 00:12:57.880 line:0%
you're not like her.

00:12:57.920 --> 00:12:58.920 line:0%
So you can only

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:00.320 line:0%
offer your viscera.

00:13:26.140 --> 00:13:27.000 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:13:28.810 --> 00:13:29.640 line:0%
Yan Xing.

00:13:30.900 --> 00:13:31.830 line:0%
Are you alright?

00:13:32.320 --> 00:13:33.120 line:0%
I'm fine.

00:13:33.320 --> 00:13:34.760 line:0%
How did you find me here?

00:13:34.760 --> 00:13:36.400 line:0%
During the fight, the Half-faced Ghost

00:13:36.400 --> 00:13:37.880 line:0%
had a piece of his clothing torn off.

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:39.400 line:0%
It had a strong scent of mixed herbs.

00:13:38.740 --> 00:13:39.810 line:0%
[East City Gate]

00:13:39.400 --> 00:13:40.080 line:0%
It reminded me of

00:13:40.080 --> 00:13:41.480 line:0%
the place with the most herbs in Yingzhou City.

00:13:41.480 --> 00:13:42.000 line:0%
It's also the place that is the least likely

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:43.200 line:0%
to be suspected,

00:13:43.360 --> 00:13:44.600 line:0%
which is Guangchun Hall.

00:13:44.600 --> 00:13:46.130 line:0%
Let's get out of here first.

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:49.320 line:0%
What's that sound?

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:00.200 line:0%
Snakes!

00:14:18.430 --> 00:14:19.560 line:0%
Shen Du, be careful!

00:14:30.520 --> 00:14:31.440 line:0%
No matter when,

00:14:32.050 --> 00:14:34.450 line:0%
you can never get yourself hurt for my sake.

00:14:41.160 --> 00:14:41.960 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:43.770 line:0%
Thank you for saving me.

00:14:44.040 --> 00:14:45.240 line:0%
When we get out of here,

00:14:45.240 --> 00:14:46.120 line:0%
let me be

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:47.450 line:0%
your good wife for once.

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:21.130 line:0%
Did you bring the money I asked for?

00:15:21.200 --> 00:15:21.920 line:0%
If I can safely leave

00:15:21.920 --> 00:15:23.490 line:0%
Yingzhou City soon,

00:15:23.540 --> 00:15:25.080 line:0%
you'll also stop being worried soon, right?

00:15:25.080 --> 00:15:26.760 line:0%
I've prepared the money.

00:15:27.700 --> 00:15:28.730 line:0%
It's placed in...

00:15:39.360 --> 00:15:40.070 line:0%
You...

00:15:40.100 --> 00:15:40.980 line:0%
How dare you...

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:44.280 line:0%
My lord won't let you off.

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:46.390 line:0%
I'm afraid you won't live to see that.

00:15:48.480 --> 00:15:49.760 line:0%
Ji Dafu, you murderer.

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:50.760 line:0%
You won't be able to escape.

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:51.480 line:0%
Guards!

00:15:57.290 --> 00:15:59.290 line:0%
Take the murderer to the death cell.

00:15:59.480 --> 00:16:00.280 line:0%
Yes, sir.

00:16:32.680 --> 00:16:34.000 line:0%
Jing Lin, hurry up.

00:16:34.430 --> 00:16:35.400 line:0%
The water has almost boiled away.

00:16:35.400 --> 00:16:37.330 line:0%
We're still waiting for your meat.

00:16:37.520 --> 00:16:38.450 line:0%
What's the rush?

00:16:38.600 --> 00:16:39.360 line:0%
Don't underestimate

00:16:39.360 --> 00:16:40.760 line:0%
my knife work.

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:42.440 line:0%
Here, Kid.

00:16:42.920 --> 00:16:44.320 line:0%
Who are you calling a kid?

00:17:14.240 --> 00:17:15.040 line:0%
Mr. Pan.

00:17:15.720 --> 00:17:16.600 line:0%
These are your

00:17:16.820 --> 00:17:18.350 line:0%
Longevity Dragon and Phoenix Stew,

00:17:18.350 --> 00:17:19.810 line:0%
Nourishing Lamb Soup,

00:17:20.379 --> 00:17:22.010 line:0%
Yam and Pork Tripe Porridge.

00:17:22.320 --> 00:17:23.520 line:0%
Please enjoy your meal.

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:24.560 line:0%
Did Secretary Yan

00:17:24.680 --> 00:17:25.629 line:0%
ask you to make me

00:17:25.629 --> 00:17:27.080 line:0%
all these dishes?

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:30.000 line:0%
Madam asked me to make you

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:31.590 line:0%
the Longevity Dragon and Phoenix Stew,

00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:33.120 line:0%
and the Nourishing Lamb Soup.

00:17:33.120 --> 00:17:35.620 line:0%
The Yam and Pork Tripe Porridge

00:17:35.890 --> 00:17:37.290 line:0%
is made for you by her.

00:17:37.960 --> 00:17:39.290 line:0%
Please enjoy your meal.

00:17:39.970 --> 00:17:41.950 line:0%
What dish did Grand Commander get?

00:17:41.970 --> 00:17:43.160 line:0%
Grand Commander

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:44.200 line:0%
only got one dish.

00:17:45.610 --> 00:17:46.520 line:0%
Madam

00:17:46.520 --> 00:17:48.730 line:0%
spent four hours making it.

00:17:48.760 --> 00:17:50.820 line:0%
It's the Ten-Ingredient Tonic Soup.

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:51.930 line:0%
Mr. Pan.

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:53.160 line:0%
Please enjoy your meal.

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:54.320 line:0%
Kid, let's go.

00:18:32.840 --> 00:18:34.520 line:0%
Your hands aren't injured.

00:18:34.640 --> 00:18:36.240 line:0%
Why can't you help yourself?

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:45.660 line:0%
I hurt my shoulder blade.

00:18:45.880 --> 00:18:46.940 line:0%
I can't lift my arm.

00:18:54.850 --> 00:18:55.860 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:18:56.250 --> 00:18:58.000 line:0%
It's been three days already.

00:18:58.280 --> 00:18:59.690 line:0%
You've already recovered.

00:18:59.690 --> 00:19:01.070 line:0%
Stop lying.

00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:03.000 line:0%
Who said

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:04.920 line:0%
she would be my good wife for once?

00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:08.050 line:0%
Just three days and you're already tired of it?

00:19:10.660 --> 00:19:12.140 line:0%
Is it possible that

00:19:12.600 --> 00:19:14.120 line:0%
"once" meant three days?

00:19:14.490 --> 00:19:15.770 line:0%
Stop making excuses.

00:19:18.840 --> 00:19:19.640 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:21.200 line:0%
I haven't asked you yet

00:19:21.430 --> 00:19:23.480 line:0%
why you pretended to be blind and deceived me.

00:19:23.480 --> 00:19:25.060 line:0%
When did you

00:19:25.080 --> 00:19:26.750 line:0%
recover from your night blindness?

00:19:26.750 --> 00:19:28.240 line:0%
The way you killed that venomous snake that day

00:19:28.240 --> 00:19:29.030 line:0%
was so good.

00:19:29.050 --> 00:19:32.380 line:0%
You were not relying on your ears to locate the snakes at all.

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:40.570 line:0%
It's been cured for a while.

00:19:40.640 --> 00:19:42.280 line:0%
For a while?

00:19:42.430 --> 00:19:43.040 line:0%
Well,

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:50.060 line:0%
when we were in hot springs that time,

00:19:50.060 --> 00:19:52.520 line:0%
he was pretending to be blind the whole time.

00:19:54.890 --> 00:19:56.130 line:0%
Drink it yourself.

00:19:58.160 --> 00:19:59.160 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:20:06.900 --> 00:20:08.000 line:0%
Speak.

00:20:10.960 --> 00:20:13.890 line:0%
Ji Dafu has been apprehended and brought to justice.

00:20:36.640 --> 00:20:37.440 line:0%
Mo Qianzhi.

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:38.530 line:0%
Stop!

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:42.560 line:0%
How dare you!

00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:45.960 line:0%
Grand Commander is to ask questions. How dare you stop him!

00:21:08.600 --> 00:21:09.600 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:21:13.390 --> 00:21:15.130 line:0%
The results of my investigation

00:21:15.130 --> 00:21:16.410 line:0%
show that Ji Dafu

00:21:16.680 --> 00:21:18.200 line:0%
is the mastermind

00:21:18.200 --> 00:21:19.640 line:0%
behind the Half-faced Ghost case.

00:21:19.640 --> 00:21:21.300 line:0%
After committing the crimes,

00:21:21.600 --> 00:21:23.160 line:0%
he gouged out Er Laipi's eyes,

00:21:23.160 --> 00:21:24.690 line:0%
cut off Li Kaixiang's head,

00:21:24.720 --> 00:21:26.780 line:0%
and gouged out Liu Zongyuan's liver.

00:21:27.660 --> 00:21:29.480 line:0%
This man's crimes are heinous ones.

00:21:29.480 --> 00:21:32.140 line:0%
Only his death will appease the people's anger.

00:21:33.760 --> 00:21:36.780 line:0%
He must die! He must die! He must die!

00:21:36.800 --> 00:21:37.520 line:0%
Kill him!

00:21:37.600 --> 00:21:38.640 line:0%
He has harmed so many people.

00:21:38.640 --> 00:21:40.160 line:0%
Killing him this way is mercy to him.

00:21:40.160 --> 00:21:40.910 line:0%
That's right.

00:21:40.910 --> 00:21:42.240 line:0%
His crimes are monstrous.

00:21:42.240 --> 00:21:43.400 line:0%
Even if he were to be killed by a thousand cuts,

00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:44.720 line:0%
it wouldn't be enough to appease the people's anger.

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:45.840 line:0%
He should be killed by a thousand cuts!

00:21:45.840 --> 00:21:47.670 line:0%
Kill him! Kill him! Kill him!

00:21:47.690 --> 00:21:49.880 line:0%
Kill him! Kill him! Kill him!

00:21:49.920 --> 00:21:50.720 line:0%
Kill him now!

00:21:50.720 --> 00:21:52.680 line:0%
He must die! He must die! He must die!

00:21:52.680 --> 00:21:55.000 line:0%
Ji Dafu established illegal gambling dens

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:56.600 line:0%
and murdered your family members.

00:21:56.600 --> 00:21:57.680 line:0%
His crimes are unforgivable.

00:21:57.680 --> 00:21:58.920 line:0%
Execute him immediately!

00:21:58.920 --> 00:21:59.720 line:0%
Wait a moment.

00:22:05.520 --> 00:22:07.560 line:0%
What do you mean by this, Secretary Yan?

00:22:07.560 --> 00:22:08.420 line:0%
Are you going to

00:22:08.680 --> 00:22:10.420 line:0%
plead for Ji Dafu?

00:22:10.720 --> 00:22:13.080 line:0%
There are still unresolved doubts in this case.

00:22:13.080 --> 00:22:14.960 line:0%
Ji Dafu has confessed to his crimes

00:22:14.960 --> 00:22:15.800 line:0%
without any reservations.

00:22:15.800 --> 00:22:17.400 line:0%
The evidence is conclusive.

00:22:18.480 --> 00:22:19.500 line:0%
The time has come.

00:22:19.760 --> 00:22:21.220 line:0%
Execute him immediately.

00:22:31.760 --> 00:22:32.760 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:22:34.240 --> 00:22:35.860 line:0%
Didn't you often say

00:22:35.890 --> 00:22:38.750 line:0%
that you wanted to eliminate threats to the people?

00:22:39.360 --> 00:22:40.280 line:0%
Why are you saving

00:22:40.280 --> 00:22:41.960 line:0%
this unforgivable criminal?

00:22:42.320 --> 00:22:44.890 line:0%
Kill him! Kill him! Kill him!

00:22:44.970 --> 00:22:49.510 line:0%
Kill him! Kill him! Kill him!

00:22:49.530 --> 00:22:53.410 line:0%
Kill him! Kill him! Kill him!

00:22:53.440 --> 00:22:55.890 line:0%
I can't die! I can't die!

00:22:56.160 --> 00:22:58.780 line:0%
I don't want to die! I don't want to die!

00:22:58.920 --> 00:23:00.330 line:0%
I don't want to...

00:23:00.480 --> 00:23:01.400 line:0%
Well done!

00:23:01.400 --> 00:23:03.260 line:0%
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

00:23:03.280 --> 00:23:05.840 line:0%
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

00:23:05.840 --> 00:23:09.990 line:0%
Well done! Well done! Good!

00:23:10.200 --> 00:23:11.720 line:0%
He deserved to die, he deserved to die.

00:23:11.720 --> 00:23:13.160 line:0%
Bravo!

00:23:13.160 --> 00:23:14.830 line:0%
Well done, well done!

00:23:16.560 --> 00:23:18.160 line:0%
Good, good.

00:23:18.760 --> 00:23:19.780 line:0%
Well done.

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:35.680 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:23:36.040 --> 00:23:37.120 line:0%
What I did

00:23:38.560 --> 00:23:40.200 line:0%
is what people wanted.

00:23:51.800 --> 00:23:53.180 line:0%
Lord Mo is good!

00:23:53.200 --> 00:23:55.010 line:0%
Lord Mo is good!

00:23:55.040 --> 00:23:56.920 line:0%
Lord Mo is good!

00:24:06.160 --> 00:24:07.560 line:0%
I smelled the scent on him

00:24:07.680 --> 00:24:09.730 line:0%
where I was imprisoned.

00:24:22.210 --> 00:24:22.970 line:0%
Jing Lin.

00:24:23.000 --> 00:24:23.640 line:0%
Yes.

00:24:24.860 --> 00:24:25.760 line:0%
Look into it.

00:24:27.800 --> 00:24:28.600 line:0%
Yes.

00:24:29.680 --> 00:24:31.210 line:0%
He's that grand commander?

00:24:31.220 --> 00:24:33.850 line:0%
The famous White Ghost in the Xiang'an City?

00:24:34.760 --> 00:24:36.160 line:0%
Then why did he try to stop the execution just now?

00:24:36.160 --> 00:24:37.080 line:0%
Who knows?

00:24:37.080 --> 00:24:39.410 line:0%
People who do evil deeds will be punished.

00:24:39.480 --> 00:24:40.280 line:0%
Let's stop talking

00:24:40.280 --> 00:24:41.280 line:0%
and leave now.

00:24:41.320 --> 00:24:42.680 line:0%
Let's go.

00:24:51.440 --> 00:24:52.240 line:0%
My Lord.

00:24:52.360 --> 00:24:53.320 line:0%
A secret message from Yingzhou.

00:24:53.320 --> 00:24:54.360 line:0%
Ji Dafu is dead.

00:24:54.360 --> 00:24:55.240 line:0%
The situation has changed.

00:24:55.240 --> 00:24:58.300 line:0%
They need to wait for the right opportunity over there.

00:25:04.720 --> 00:25:05.520 line:0%
Forget it.

00:25:06.040 --> 00:25:07.720 line:0%
It's just a drop in the bucket.

00:25:08.240 --> 00:25:09.370 line:0%
It's not important.

00:25:13.480 --> 00:25:15.520 line:0%
Yingzhou is just the beginning.

00:25:15.840 --> 00:25:17.800 line:0%
A lone wolf can hardly achieve anything.

00:25:17.800 --> 00:25:20.120 line:0%
Keep a close eye on other places.

00:25:20.560 --> 00:25:22.360 line:0%
Strike when they're unprepared

00:25:22.690 --> 00:25:24.620 line:0%
and then we'll make it.

00:25:24.800 --> 00:25:25.600 line:0%
Yes.

00:25:41.960 --> 00:25:42.900 line:0%
How are the arrangements

00:25:42.900 --> 00:25:45.020 line:0%
in Nanlang and Xichen?

00:25:45.760 --> 00:25:48.920 line:0%
Everything has been done according to your instructions.

00:25:48.920 --> 00:25:49.720 line:0%
Good.

00:25:52.080 --> 00:25:53.520 line:0%
If the god aids me,

00:25:53.970 --> 00:25:55.900 line:0%
I will surely triumph over the god.

00:25:56.560 --> 00:25:57.960 line:0%
If the god does not aid me,

00:25:58.440 --> 00:26:00.400 line:0%
I will defy the god.

00:26:05.600 --> 00:26:06.900 line:0%
The people of Yingzhou City

00:26:06.680 --> 00:26:10.850 line:0%
[Virtue and Goodness]

00:26:07.120 --> 00:26:08.120 line:0%
are all rejoicing over

00:26:08.120 --> 00:26:09.050 line:0%
Ji Dafu's death.

00:26:10.640 --> 00:26:12.040 line:0%
That's understandable.

00:26:12.130 --> 00:26:13.920 line:0%
Ji Dafu committed so many crimes.

00:26:13.920 --> 00:26:15.180 line:0%
The people of Yingzhou

00:26:15.200 --> 00:26:16.320 line:0%
were all terrified because of

00:26:16.320 --> 00:26:17.120 line:0%
the Half-faced Ghost incident.

00:26:17.120 --> 00:26:18.360 line:0%
They hated his guts.

00:26:18.920 --> 00:26:21.450 line:0%
Now the criminal has been brought to justice.

00:26:22.200 --> 00:26:23.400 line:0%
They should be happy.

00:26:26.680 --> 00:26:27.720 line:0%
What a pity.

00:26:28.480 --> 00:26:29.960 line:0%
The people are praising

00:26:29.960 --> 00:26:32.160 line:0%
Mo Qianzhi for his great achievements.

00:26:32.600 --> 00:26:33.800 line:0%
But it was obvious that Ji Dafu

00:26:33.800 --> 00:26:35.760 line:0%
had been tortured severely.

00:26:36.040 --> 00:26:37.920 line:0%
He was inexplicably mad.

00:26:39.680 --> 00:26:41.680 line:0%
We've lost our leads again.

00:26:42.200 --> 00:26:43.440 line:0%
Now all the people of Yingzhou

00:26:43.440 --> 00:26:44.440 line:0%
have seen

00:26:45.360 --> 00:26:46.840 line:0%
Mo Qianzhi's hatred for evil,

00:26:46.840 --> 00:26:48.680 line:0%
and his order for immediate execution.

00:26:48.680 --> 00:26:49.720 line:0%
They saw me

00:26:50.240 --> 00:26:51.300 line:0%
trying to stop him.

00:26:52.400 --> 00:26:54.520 line:0%
He is praised by everyone

00:26:54.640 --> 00:26:55.400 line:0%
while you

00:26:55.400 --> 00:26:56.800 line:0%
are the terrifying

00:26:56.800 --> 00:26:57.800 line:0%
White Ghost.

00:26:58.160 --> 00:26:59.280 line:0%
You and Lord Mo

00:26:59.320 --> 00:27:00.880 line:0%
are just completely different

00:27:00.880 --> 00:27:02.280 line:0%
in the eyes of the people.

00:27:02.960 --> 00:27:04.420 line:0%
I have a clear conscience.

00:27:05.120 --> 00:27:06.600 line:0%
Why care what others say about me?

00:27:06.600 --> 00:27:07.880 line:0%
The rumors and gossip can hurt.

00:27:07.880 --> 00:27:08.940 line:0%
I'm afraid that...

00:27:13.320 --> 00:27:18.950 line:0%
[Virtue and Goodness]

00:27:14.360 --> 00:27:15.000 line:0%
Governor Mo

00:27:15.000 --> 00:27:16.530 line:0%
publicly executed Ji Dafu.

00:27:16.920 --> 00:27:18.340 line:0%
Looks like he was appeasing the public,

00:27:18.340 --> 00:27:19.470 line:0%
but it's also weird.

00:27:20.080 --> 00:27:20.800 line:0%
The way he dealt with this matter

00:27:20.800 --> 00:27:23.160 line:0%
is not in line with his usual cautious approach

00:27:23.160 --> 00:27:24.360 line:0%
to handling matters.

00:27:31.480 --> 00:27:32.280 line:0%
When Half-faced Ghosts

00:27:32.280 --> 00:27:34.140 line:0%
were causing trouble in the city,

00:27:35.240 --> 00:27:37.300 line:0%
the Day of Three Yangs was mentioned.

00:27:38.920 --> 00:27:39.720 line:0%
I remember at that time,

00:27:39.720 --> 00:27:41.600 line:0%
his expression was somewhat weird.

00:27:41.600 --> 00:27:43.200 line:0%
What's so special about the Day of Three Yangs?

00:27:43.200 --> 00:27:44.560 line:0%
Isn't it coming soon?

00:27:47.970 --> 00:27:49.010 line:0%
Wait a moment.

00:27:48.700 --> 00:27:53.040 line:0%
[Virtue and Goodness]

00:27:49.210 --> 00:27:50.760 line:0%
My mother once said

00:27:50.840 --> 00:27:52.240 line:0%
that this year's Day of Three Yangs

00:27:52.240 --> 00:27:53.680 line:0%
was different from the previous ones.

00:27:53.680 --> 00:27:55.760 line:0%
It's a rare occurrence in decades.

00:27:55.760 --> 00:27:58.420 line:0%
It's the Day of Three Yangs of Absolute Killing.

00:27:58.830 --> 00:28:01.230 line:0%
The Day of Three Yangs of Absolute Killing?

00:28:01.490 --> 00:28:02.620 line:0%
What does that mean?

00:28:02.730 --> 00:28:04.160 line:0%
Anyway, it's just a day when many things can't be done.

00:28:04.160 --> 00:28:05.400 line:0%
She told me to be very careful that day

00:28:05.400 --> 00:28:07.200 line:0%
and not to go out at all.

00:28:07.200 --> 00:28:07.920 line:0%
But

00:28:07.920 --> 00:28:09.560 line:0%
my mother believes in everything.

00:28:09.560 --> 00:28:10.840 line:0%
It's just hearsay.

00:28:11.600 --> 00:28:13.460 line:0%
But from what I know of Mo Qianzhi,

00:28:14.120 --> 00:28:17.380 line:0%
he's not the kind of person who will care about such things.

00:28:20.720 --> 00:28:21.720 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:28:22.960 --> 00:28:24.760 line:0%
How's the investigation going?

00:28:25.880 --> 00:28:27.640 line:0%
It's just as you predicted, Grand Commander.

00:28:27.640 --> 00:28:29.370 line:0%
I visited several households.

00:28:29.440 --> 00:28:30.520 line:0%
On that day, on the city wall,

00:28:30.520 --> 00:28:32.240 line:0%
the girls kidnapped by Half-faced Ghosts

00:28:32.240 --> 00:28:33.240 line:0%
were all rescued by the people

00:28:33.240 --> 00:28:34.500 line:0%
from Lord Mo's office.

00:28:34.680 --> 00:28:35.480 line:0%
However,

00:28:35.600 --> 00:28:37.120 line:0%
there was no news afterward

00:28:37.120 --> 00:28:38.600 line:0%
about them being sent home.

00:28:38.600 --> 00:28:39.360 line:0%
What?

00:28:39.380 --> 00:28:40.840 line:0%
Where are those girls now?

00:28:44.000 --> 00:28:44.640 line:0%
Could it be

00:28:44.640 --> 00:28:47.040 line:0%
that they were really taken away by Lord Mo?

00:28:48.920 --> 00:28:50.800 line:0%
It seems that Half-faced Ghosts in the city that day

00:28:50.800 --> 00:28:52.760 line:0%
weren't randomly kidnapping girls,

00:28:52.760 --> 00:28:53.640 line:0%
but purposefully

00:28:53.640 --> 00:28:55.240 line:0%
took those young women away.

00:28:57.300 --> 00:28:58.420 line:0%
But I've checked

00:28:59.240 --> 00:29:00.360 line:0%
those girls' family backgrounds

00:29:00.360 --> 00:29:01.360 line:0%
and connections.

00:29:01.800 --> 00:29:04.130 line:0%
And there's nothing in common among them.

00:29:13.490 --> 00:29:14.560 line:0%
It's Mo Xiuxiu.

00:29:17.790 --> 00:29:18.590 line:0%
Xiuxiu?

00:29:19.320 --> 00:29:20.040 line:0%
Do you remember

00:29:20.040 --> 00:29:21.120 line:0%
there was a portrait of Mo Xiuxiu

00:29:21.120 --> 00:29:22.520 line:0%
hanging in Mo's Mansion?

00:29:23.240 --> 00:29:24.500 line:0%
Including Du Xiaowan,

00:29:24.790 --> 00:29:25.760 line:0%
the five women who were kidnapped

00:29:25.760 --> 00:29:27.200 line:0%
by Half-faced Ghost that day

00:29:27.200 --> 00:29:28.560 line:0%
have facial features

00:29:28.560 --> 00:29:29.200 line:0%
that bear some resemblance

00:29:29.200 --> 00:29:30.480 line:0%
to Mo Xiuxiu's.

00:29:35.080 --> 00:29:35.800 line:0%
What if all of this

00:29:35.800 --> 00:29:37.040 line:0%
isn't a coincidence?

00:29:38.640 --> 00:29:39.760 line:0%
Ji Dafu is dead.

00:29:41.680 --> 00:29:44.280 line:0%
The matter in the Yingzhou City isn't over yet.

00:29:47.970 --> 00:29:49.450 line:0%
If it's really as we think,

00:29:50.160 --> 00:29:51.760 line:0%
I'm afraid he and the Fire Moth Sect behind him

00:29:51.760 --> 00:29:53.000 line:0%
have been in cahoots for a long time.

00:29:53.000 --> 00:29:54.320 line:0%
On the Day of Three Yangs,

00:29:54.320 --> 00:29:55.920 line:0%
they will take action again.

00:29:56.640 --> 00:29:58.040 line:0%
So what should we do next?

00:29:58.120 --> 00:29:58.920 line:0%
Search.

00:30:00.280 --> 00:30:01.080 line:0%
Search?

00:30:04.040 --> 00:30:04.840 line:0%
Search.

00:30:05.680 --> 00:30:07.160 line:0%
Those women who were abducted

00:30:07.160 --> 00:30:08.360 line:0%
are a vital clue.

00:30:09.880 --> 00:30:11.310 line:0%
Yingzhou is so big.

00:30:11.370 --> 00:30:13.370 line:0%
Where could these people be hidden?

00:30:17.780 --> 00:30:18.600 line:0%
They must be

00:30:18.600 --> 00:30:20.400 line:0%
in one of the impossible places.

00:30:32.320 --> 00:30:33.120 line:0%
My Lord.

00:30:33.360 --> 00:30:34.560 line:0%
Everything is ready.

00:30:34.680 --> 00:30:36.810 line:0%
Just waiting for the auspicious time.

00:30:37.400 --> 00:30:38.200 line:0%
Very good.

00:30:38.920 --> 00:30:39.720 line:0%
Xiuxiu.

00:30:40.320 --> 00:30:41.630 line:0%
No matter what,

00:30:41.850 --> 00:30:43.720 line:0%
I will activate the formation today

00:30:43.720 --> 00:30:44.980 line:0%
to bring you back to life.

00:30:44.980 --> 00:30:45.780 line:0%
Brother Mo,

00:30:50.390 --> 00:30:52.010 line:0%
please let me go.

00:30:52.770 --> 00:30:55.030 line:0%
Considering I've always been obedient,

00:30:55.670 --> 00:30:57.510 line:0%
I beg you not to kill me.

00:30:57.560 --> 00:30:58.780 line:0%
Please release me.

00:30:59.200 --> 00:31:01.220 line:0%
I don't want to die yet.

00:31:18.400 --> 00:31:19.200 line:0%
Jing Lin.

00:31:24.040 --> 00:31:24.840 line:0%
Xiuxiu.

00:31:33.720 --> 00:31:34.800 line:0%
Fortunately, we arrived in time.

00:31:34.800 --> 00:31:36.200 line:0%
They're all still alive.

00:31:39.780 --> 00:31:40.580 line:0%
Xiuxiu.

00:31:53.040 --> 00:31:53.840 line:0%
Brother.

00:31:54.480 --> 00:31:55.280 line:0%
Brother.

00:31:55.440 --> 00:31:56.440 line:0%
Is it beautiful?

00:32:00.770 --> 00:32:01.610 line:0%
Yes.

00:32:03.040 --> 00:32:03.840 line:0%
Brother.

00:32:06.440 --> 00:32:07.440 line:0%
Brother Mo.

00:32:10.910 --> 00:32:11.750 line:0%
No way.

00:32:13.260 --> 00:32:15.260 line:0%
Xiuxiu wouldn't call me Brother Mo.

00:32:15.480 --> 00:32:17.080 line:0%
She would only call me brother.

00:32:17.080 --> 00:32:18.230 line:0%
No way.

00:32:18.400 --> 00:32:19.560 line:0%
It shouldn't have failed!

00:32:19.560 --> 00:32:21.020 line:0%
It shouldn't have failed!

00:32:21.110 --> 00:32:22.250 line:0%
It's you.

00:32:22.360 --> 00:32:24.080 line:0%
You scared away Xiuxiu's soul,

00:32:24.080 --> 00:32:25.620 line:0%
making her unable to find her way back.

00:32:25.620 --> 00:32:26.560 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:32:26.680 --> 00:32:28.280 line:0%
You're so callous.

00:32:28.300 --> 00:32:29.610 line:0%
In this world,

00:32:30.560 --> 00:32:33.020 line:0%
there's no way to bring the dead back to life.

00:32:34.960 --> 00:32:35.760 line:0%
He's gone so mad

00:32:35.760 --> 00:32:37.760 line:0%
that he's almost lost his humanity.

00:32:38.820 --> 00:32:40.180 line:0%
Humanity?

00:32:48.000 --> 00:32:49.280 line:0%
If you don't know about others' pains,

00:32:49.280 --> 00:32:50.660 line:0%
don't ask them to be kind.

00:32:50.660 --> 00:32:51.660 line:0%
Shen Du,

00:32:52.050 --> 00:32:52.970 line:0%
you should

00:32:53.360 --> 00:32:54.920 line:0%
know this very well.

00:32:56.160 --> 00:32:58.150 line:0%
If it were possible to resurrect

00:32:58.170 --> 00:32:59.040 line:0%
those who died unjustly,

00:32:59.040 --> 00:33:00.570 line:0%
what choice would you make?

00:33:03.400 --> 00:33:04.200 line:0%
Xiuxiu

00:33:04.800 --> 00:33:06.870 line:0%
was the kindest,

00:33:07.320 --> 00:33:09.480 line:0%
the most innocent person in this world.

00:33:09.480 --> 00:33:10.620 line:0%
But those despicable people

00:33:10.620 --> 00:33:12.000 line:0%
caused her death.

00:33:12.280 --> 00:33:13.310 line:0%
Mo Xiuxiu?

00:33:15.530 --> 00:33:17.300 line:0%
Wasn't she ill?

00:33:18.080 --> 00:33:18.880 line:0%
Who exactly

00:33:21.730 --> 00:33:23.710 line:0%
harmed Xiuxiu?

00:33:24.500 --> 00:33:25.950 line:0%
Before she died,

00:33:26.140 --> 00:33:27.540 line:0%
Xiuxiu kept asking,

00:33:28.320 --> 00:33:29.320 line:0%
"Why?"

00:33:29.840 --> 00:33:31.960 line:0%
"What did I do wrong?"

00:33:39.440 --> 00:33:40.580 line:0%
Give us some food, please.

00:33:40.580 --> 00:33:42.440 line:0%
Please, give us something to eat.

00:33:42.660 --> 00:33:43.700 line:0%
What's going on?

00:33:43.860 --> 00:33:44.900 line:0%
[Mo Xiuxiu]

00:33:43.920 --> 00:33:44.600 line:0%
My Lord.

00:33:44.640 --> 00:33:46.770 line:0%
There are refugees blocking the road.

00:33:51.400 --> 00:33:52.960 line:0%
Distribute some food to them.

00:33:52.960 --> 00:33:53.600 line:0%
Yes.

00:33:55.600 --> 00:33:56.400 line:0%
Brother.

00:33:56.480 --> 00:33:57.860 line:0%
As we get closer and closer to Yingzhou,

00:33:57.860 --> 00:33:59.520 line:0%
there are more and more refugees.

00:33:59.520 --> 00:34:00.240 line:0%
In the future,

00:34:00.240 --> 00:34:02.080 line:0%
if you take charge of Gannan Area,

00:34:02.080 --> 00:34:04.080 line:0%
I hope you will

00:34:04.080 --> 00:34:05.520 line:0%
provide shelter and assistance

00:34:05.520 --> 00:34:07.240 line:0%
for these refugees, giving them a place of stability.

00:34:07.240 --> 00:34:08.360 line:0%
My dear sister.

00:34:09.080 --> 00:34:10.810 line:0%
You are just too kind-hearted.

00:34:30.280 --> 00:34:31.120 line:0%
Come, Xiuxiu.

00:34:31.120 --> 00:34:32.080 line:0%
Welcome.

00:34:33.360 --> 00:34:35.030 line:0%
Please, come in. This way, please.

00:34:35.030 --> 00:34:36.430 line:0%
Let's stay here for the night.

00:34:36.430 --> 00:34:38.560 line:0%
The horses are tired after a day's journey.

00:34:38.560 --> 00:34:39.680 line:0%
Please, come in.

00:34:45.760 --> 00:34:46.560 line:0%
Miss.

00:34:46.720 --> 00:34:47.950 line:0%
Are you feeling unwell?

00:34:47.950 --> 00:34:48.720 line:0%
Let me take you there

00:34:48.720 --> 00:34:49.800 line:0%
so you can have a rest.

00:34:49.800 --> 00:34:50.880 line:0%
No, no, it's not necessary.

00:34:50.880 --> 00:34:52.510 line:0%
My family needs water badly.

00:34:52.600 --> 00:34:54.160 line:0%
I must hurry back with it.

00:34:54.560 --> 00:34:55.920 line:0%
You're beautiful and kind-hearted.

00:34:55.920 --> 00:34:57.400 line:0%
Would you walk with me for a while?

00:34:57.400 --> 00:34:58.200 line:0%
Alright.

00:34:58.280 --> 00:34:59.600 line:0%
Let me help you over there.

00:34:59.600 --> 00:35:00.560 line:0%
Thank you, Miss.

00:35:03.200 --> 00:35:04.000 line:0%
Let's go.

00:35:30.560 --> 00:35:32.220 line:0%
Help me! Help me!

00:35:32.440 --> 00:35:33.960 line:0%
I just encountered some bad people.

00:35:33.960 --> 00:35:35.560 line:0%
My family is waiting for me at the post station.

00:35:35.560 --> 00:35:37.490 line:0%
Please, can you take me back there?

00:35:39.280 --> 00:35:40.320 line:0%
Don't worry.

00:35:40.350 --> 00:35:41.550 line:0%
I will save you.

00:35:42.400 --> 00:35:43.080 line:0%
Xiuxiu.

00:35:43.080 --> 00:35:44.340 line:0%
Don't come any closer!

00:35:44.560 --> 00:35:45.360 line:0%
No!

00:35:45.880 --> 00:35:46.640 line:0%
Stay away!

00:35:46.640 --> 00:35:47.240 line:0%
Xiuxiu.

00:35:48.080 --> 00:35:48.640 line:0%
Xiuxiu.

00:35:50.080 --> 00:35:51.080 line:0%
It's alright now.

00:35:52.600 --> 00:35:53.600 line:0%
Come back with me.

00:35:53.840 --> 00:35:55.160 line:0%
No one will hurt you anymore.

00:35:55.160 --> 00:35:55.800 line:0%
No.

00:35:56.880 --> 00:35:57.760 line:0%
I was wrong.

00:35:57.760 --> 00:35:58.720 line:0%
Brother.

00:35:58.800 --> 00:36:00.400 line:0%
I just wanted to help people.

00:36:01.080 --> 00:36:02.600 line:0%
What did I do wrong?

00:36:02.600 --> 00:36:03.320 line:0%
Xiuxiu.

00:36:03.680 --> 00:36:04.480 line:0%
Xiuxiu.

00:36:05.480 --> 00:36:06.180 line:0%
Don't.

00:36:07.160 --> 00:36:08.150 line:0%
Xiuxiu!

00:36:08.800 --> 00:36:10.480 line:0%
Xiuxiu!

00:36:18.600 --> 00:36:19.610 line:0%
Brother.

00:36:52.830 --> 00:36:53.870 line:0%
Who are you?

00:36:55.600 --> 00:36:57.000 line:0%
Who I am is not important.

00:36:57.520 --> 00:36:59.980 line:0%
If you want to resurrect your sister,

00:37:00.480 --> 00:37:02.000 line:0%
I can help you.

00:37:04.380 --> 00:37:06.290 line:0%
Resurrecting the dead?

00:37:06.490 --> 00:37:07.940 line:0%
How preposterous.

00:37:08.520 --> 00:37:09.770 line:0%
In this big world,

00:37:09.800 --> 00:37:11.360 line:0%
there are all sorts of wonders.

00:37:11.360 --> 00:37:12.720 line:0%
Just because there isn't one in Cang State

00:37:12.720 --> 00:37:14.560 line:0%
doesn't mean I can't make it happen.

00:37:14.560 --> 00:37:17.280 line:0%
As long as you're devout enough, I'll help you.

00:37:46.480 --> 00:37:47.480 line:0%
Do you really know

00:37:47.820 --> 00:37:49.280 line:0%
how to resurrect the dead?

00:37:49.500 --> 00:37:50.340 line:0%
Of course.

00:37:58.850 --> 00:38:00.810 line:0%
Fire moths are reborn through fire,

00:38:00.810 --> 00:38:03.080 line:0%
which is the essence of the Fire Moth Sect.

00:38:03.080 --> 00:38:05.280 line:0%
If you are willing to follow me,

00:38:05.600 --> 00:38:06.620 line:0%
I

00:38:06.840 --> 00:38:08.880 line:0%
can resurrect your sister.

00:38:12.970 --> 00:38:15.370 line:0%
As long as you can bring Xiuxiu back to life,

00:38:15.600 --> 00:38:16.760 line:0%
I, Mo Qianzhi,

00:38:18.540 --> 00:38:20.800 line:0%
will follow your lead without question.

00:38:23.390 --> 00:38:25.320 line:0%
Her resurrection techniques

00:38:25.760 --> 00:38:26.520 line:0%
are just lies

00:38:26.520 --> 00:38:28.080 line:0%
to get your trust.

00:38:28.760 --> 00:38:30.160 line:0%
You had an obsession in your mind,

00:38:30.160 --> 00:38:31.840 line:0%
so you would listen and believe.

00:38:31.840 --> 00:38:32.640 line:0%
Senior.

00:38:33.560 --> 00:38:34.640 line:0%
Don't you know

00:38:35.450 --> 00:38:37.430 line:0%
that under your protection,

00:38:38.480 --> 00:38:40.000 line:0%
the Fire Moth Sect in Gannan Area

00:38:40.000 --> 00:38:41.240 line:0%
has been committing crimes for years,

00:38:41.240 --> 00:38:42.960 line:0%
and has killed countless people?

00:38:42.960 --> 00:38:43.920 line:0%
Do you still believe

00:38:43.920 --> 00:38:45.400 line:0%
they will resurrect Mo Xiuxiu?

00:38:45.400 --> 00:38:46.930 line:0%
Why shouldn't I believe it?

00:38:47.560 --> 00:38:49.420 line:0%
Do have any reason not believe it?

00:38:49.600 --> 00:38:51.360 line:0%
As long as Xiuxiu can be resurrected,

00:38:51.360 --> 00:38:52.760 line:0%
killing a few more people

00:38:52.800 --> 00:38:53.960 line:0%
doesn't matter.

00:38:54.600 --> 00:38:56.170 line:0%
Those people were jerks.

00:38:56.400 --> 00:38:57.960 line:0%
Didn't they deserve to die?

00:38:59.880 --> 00:39:01.880 line:0%
It's the Half-faced Ghosts from Guangchun Hall

00:39:01.880 --> 00:39:03.730 line:0%
that killed those people for me.

00:39:04.160 --> 00:39:05.920 line:0%
Xiuxiu kindly saved the refugees,

00:39:05.920 --> 00:39:07.160 line:0%
but was then abused

00:39:07.160 --> 00:39:08.320 line:0%
and killed by another group of villains.

00:39:08.320 --> 00:39:10.160 line:0%
How could this revenge not be taken?

00:39:10.160 --> 00:39:12.210 line:0%
Help me! Help me!

00:39:12.400 --> 00:39:13.160 line:0%
Someone wants to kill me!

00:39:13.160 --> 00:39:13.560 line:0%
Don't be afraid.

00:39:13.560 --> 00:39:13.960 line:0%
Save me!

00:39:13.960 --> 00:39:14.760 line:0%
In broad daylight,

00:39:14.760 --> 00:39:16.000 line:0%
how can you not follow the law?

00:39:16.000 --> 00:39:16.960 line:0%
Our lord is here.

00:39:16.960 --> 00:39:18.490 line:0%
We will surely protect you.

00:39:18.600 --> 00:39:19.480 line:0%
It's them!

00:39:19.560 --> 00:39:20.800 line:0%
They're the ones who want to kill me!

00:39:20.800 --> 00:39:22.440 line:0%
Why do they want to kill you?

00:39:34.960 --> 00:39:35.880 line:0%
Xiuxiu.

00:39:37.400 --> 00:39:39.450 line:0%
I've come to avenge you.

00:39:39.560 --> 00:39:41.090 line:0%
They all deserved to die.

00:39:41.240 --> 00:39:42.980 line:0%
They should die with Xiuxiu.

00:39:43.280 --> 00:39:44.210 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:39:44.400 --> 00:39:46.160 line:0%
Why did you disrupt the ceremony?

00:39:46.160 --> 00:39:47.000 line:0%
Why won't you

00:39:47.440 --> 00:39:49.560 line:0%
let me bring Xiuxiu back to life?

00:39:49.600 --> 00:39:51.260 line:0%
Those people deserved to die.

00:39:51.520 --> 00:39:52.480 line:0%
What about them?

00:39:55.150 --> 00:39:56.750 line:0%
What did they do wrong?

00:39:57.020 --> 00:39:59.230 line:0%
This world has always been unfair.

00:39:59.560 --> 00:40:00.360 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:40:00.880 --> 00:40:02.320 line:0%
You know this, don't you?

00:40:02.680 --> 00:40:04.740 line:0%
You use others' lives as sacrifices.

00:40:05.000 --> 00:40:06.920 line:0%
You didn't hesitate to take five lives

00:40:06.920 --> 00:40:09.320 line:0%
to exchange for the resurrection you want.

00:40:09.420 --> 00:40:10.680 line:0%
Even if you succeeded,

00:40:11.200 --> 00:40:12.260 line:0%
do you think Xiuxiu

00:40:14.160 --> 00:40:16.760 line:0%
could truly accept it with a clear conscience?

00:40:24.720 --> 00:40:25.520 line:0%
Senior.

00:40:28.790 --> 00:40:31.230 line:0%
Xiuxiu is already dead.

00:40:31.540 --> 00:40:33.220 line:0%
Xiuxiu is not dead.

00:40:35.160 --> 00:40:36.840 line:0%
I will bring her back to life.

00:40:46.360 --> 00:40:47.160 line:0%
Guards!

00:41:12.920 --> 00:41:14.720 line:0%
They made up lies about resurrection

00:41:14.720 --> 00:41:16.040 line:0%
to bewitch people.

00:41:16.990 --> 00:41:18.590 line:0%
They get people's viscera

00:41:19.080 --> 00:41:20.540 line:0%
for sacrificial rituals.

00:41:21.360 --> 00:41:22.240 line:0%
So,

00:41:22.840 --> 00:41:24.900 line:0%
after Mrs. Tang committed the crime,

00:41:24.960 --> 00:41:26.560 line:0%
she removed the victim's viscera

00:41:26.560 --> 00:41:28.360 line:0%
because she was also deceived by the Fire Moth Sect,

00:41:28.360 --> 00:41:30.620 line:0%
wanting to perform this resurrection ritual.

00:41:30.620 --> 00:41:31.950 line:0%
They created mysteries

00:41:32.160 --> 00:41:33.220 line:0%
and spread terror.

00:41:34.240 --> 00:41:36.370 line:0%
Only by making people feel awe and fear

00:41:37.240 --> 00:41:38.000 line:0%
can the Fire Moth Sect

00:41:38.000 --> 00:41:40.130 line:0%
completely control their followers.

00:41:43.280 --> 00:41:44.080 line:0%
Xiuxiu.

00:41:46.680 --> 00:41:47.480 line:0%
Be careful.

00:41:48.200 --> 00:41:49.000 line:0%
Be careful.

00:41:55.000 --> 00:41:55.880 line:0%
Lord Yan.

00:41:56.750 --> 00:41:57.840 line:0%
Is there really no way

00:41:57.840 --> 00:42:00.120 line:0%
to bring the dead back to life?